ncz-screensavers (0.7.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The standalone settings application is no longer part of the engine package.
    It is now the reference GTK4 application (contrib/gtk4-reference-app) in its own
    binary package, ncz-screensavers-gtk4-reference, built from this source and
    released with it. NCZ-OS uses the Singularity plugin (ncz-screensavers-plugin)
    and does not install the reference application; upgrading the engine removes
    the old ncz-screensaver-settings files and its desktop entry.
  * ncz-screensaver ensure-plugin turns the plugin on once per user at login
    (from ncz-screensaver-idled.service) without touching the rest of the list.
  * GPU classes (weak, mid, strong): calibration, per-hack requirements, class
    aware pools, vendor-agnostic per-process offload, broken.tsv.
  * docs/CLI-CONTRACT.md and docs/IMPLEMENTING-ON-ANOTHER-DISTRO.md describe the
    interface a front end or another distribution implements.
  * Password-only test harness transport.

 -- Jason Perlow <jperlow@gmail.com>  Tue, 29 Sep 2026 17:30:00 -0400

ncz-screensavers (0.6.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Classics on the shader engine: voronoi, gravitywell, hexstrut, cubestorm,
    crackberg, cityflow, noof, geodesic and gibson are native GLES3 programs
    (src/classics_shader); binary names are unchanged. The GL1 emulation
    layer, the legacy binaries and any gl4es routing are gone from the ship
    set (no glBegin/glVertex/glu symbols in any shipped binary).
  * Real 4K measurements on the Sky1 (MS-R1, output scale 1.75): the Mali
    1080-line render cap stays; render-hints.tsv regenerated at that point.
  * Test-only NCZ_TEST_SURFACE_SIZE knob; eval tools use password auth only.
  * debian/copyright: stanzas for the ported classics.

 -- Jason Perlow <jperlow@gmail.com>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 03:00:00 +0000

ncz-screensavers (0.6.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The nine remaining OpenGL 1 classics (voronoi, gravitywell, hexstrut, cubestorm,
    crackberg, cityflow, noof, geodesic, gibson) are native GLES3 shader-engine ports
    with retained buffers and instancing (classic and enhanced styles, options per
    hack); cityflow no longer renders as flat polygons.
  * hypertorus, klein and projectiveplane lose their fixed-function fallback.
  * The GL1 immediate-mode layer, gl4es support and every hack not in the ship set
    (Black Hole, hyprsaver, xshadertoy, the twelve classics) are removed from the source
    tree and the package.

 -- Jason Perlow <jperlow@gmail.com>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 00:30:00 +0000

ncz-screensavers (0.5.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * GPU classes: NCZ_GPU_CLASS (weak, mid, strong) or inferred from
    GL_RENDERER; weak GPUs (Intel UHD) start at render scale 0.5 and Black Hole
    drops bloom and halves nebula and star density. All presets declare
    min-gpu-class and measured fps (presets.tsv columns 8 and 9).
  * NCZ_ALLOW_SOFTWARE_FALLBACK accepted as an alias (only without a GPU).

