ncz-screensavers (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Black Hole: configurable through one option table (command line,
    NCZ_BLACKHOLE_<OPTION>, blackhole.conf): 26 options, three new palettes
    (singularity, slingshot, whitehole), eight camera flyby types, palette
    cycling with cross-fades, spin, bloom, exposure, beaming and more.
    Declarative option schema installed under share/ncz-screensavers/options.
  * Fix the once-per-second stutter: the diagnostic framebuffer readbacks in
    the harness, xshadertoy and transitions are now opt-in.
  * Shared harness: --help/--version/--list-options for every hack, unknown
    options are an error, render-scale and max-render-height (wp_viewport
    upscaling, Mali defaults to 1080p), adaptive scale, per-run [stats] line.
  * Refuse to software render on a machine that has a GPU (exit 3).
  * Black Hole adaptive ray-step quality that converges without oscillating.

 -- Jason Perlow <jperlow@gmail.com>  Tue, 29 Sep 2026 18:00:00 +0000

